/// Localized capital city names for every country in [WorldCountriesData].
///
/// Source: Wikidata capital (P36) labels, curated for the 20 supported
/// languages. Turkish values mirror [TravelCountry.capital]; entries equal to
/// the English name are omitted and resolved via the English fallback.
class CapitalLocalization {
  CapitalLocalization._();

